<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Evolve</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">66yXJVQd35o4YAudOI5Ygk</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.380" end="00:03.170">During development, girls brains tend to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.170" end="00:06.520">Mature about one to two years earlier than boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.520" end="00:10.530">Angel above me, you've been calling me a lowlife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.530" end="00:14.120">You take my money and you spend it on a power trip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.120" end="00:18.310">You keep on saying that I gotta get my soul right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.310" end="00:22.090">You wanna hold me but I gotta get a grip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.090" end="00:26.010">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.010" end="00:29.630">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.630" end="00:33.180">Get a pink limousine, crème de la crème, you know what I mean? (When you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.180" end="00:37.260">I know you can make me a man from a monkey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.260" end="00:41.120">I know that I lost all, lost all control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.120" end="00:44.920">I know that I got to, I got to evolve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.920" end="00:48.380">I know that I lost all, lost all control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.380" end="00:51.990">To la-la-la-la-love you, I got to evolve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.990" end="00:55.600">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.600" end="00:59.330">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.330" end="01:03.360">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.360" end="01:07.360">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.360" end="01:08.860" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Goddamit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.990" end="01:12.020">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.020" end="01:15.680">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.680" end="01:19.080">Get a pink limousine, crème de la crème, you know what I mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.080" end="01:23.760">I know you can make me a man from a monkey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.760" end="01:25.830">She a little bit older</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.830" end="01:27.730">And I'm begging and I'm cheating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.730" end="01:31.540">Wait for me, wait for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.540" end="01:33.470">And the love is so hard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.470" end="01:35.450">And the honey is sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.450" end="01:41.290">Wait for me, wait for me, wait for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.290" end="01:49.290">Wait for me, wait for me, wait for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.280" end="01:56.930">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.930" end="01:59.860">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.860" end="02:04.100">When you gonna grow up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.100" end="02:09.570">When you gonna grow up? (Goddamit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.570" end="02:13.280">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.280" end="02:16.920">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.920" end="02:20.570">Get a pink limousine, crème de la crème, you know what I mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.570" end="02:24.100">I know you can make me a man from a monkey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.100" end="02:25.600" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(When you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.950" end="02:28.840">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.840" end="02:32.550">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.550" end="02:36.570">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.570" end="02:40.270">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.270" end="02:44.240">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.240" end="02:47.970">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.970" end="02:51.870">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.870" end="02:55.680">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.680" end="02:59.330">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.330" end="03:03.230">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.230" end="03:07.280">But I wanna have fun, I wanna get high, I wanna get drunk (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.280" end="03:13.670">I wanna do drugs, I wanna make love, I wanna get - (when you gonna grow up?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.670" end="03:17.670" /></div></body></tt>